## Logs and Debugging

### Log Locations

| Component | Log Location |
|-----------|--------------|
| MARK Console | `logs/mark.log` |
| API Server | Console output / `pino` logs |
| Dashboard | Browser DevTools Console |
| Ollama | `~/.ollama/logs/` or `journalctl -u ollama` |
| Tests | `pytest --log-cli-level=DEBUG` |

### Enable Debug Logging

```bash
# MARK console
export LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
python -m smartagent

# Or in .env
LOG_LEVEL=DEBUG
```

### Useful Debug Commands

```bash
# MARK internal state
mark> debug --help
mark> memory list
mark> project show

# System state
mark> validate
mark> workspace scan .

# Git state
mark> git status
mark> git diff
```

---

## Recovery Procedures

### Reset MARK State

```bash
# Clear memory/cache
rm -rf logs/
rm -rf .mark_memory/
rm -rf .project_context/

# Re-scan project
mark> project scan
```

### Reset Dashboard

```bash
cd artifacts/mark-dashboard
rm -rf node_modules dist .vite
pnpm install
pnpm run dev
```

### Reset API Server

```bash
cd artifacts/api-server
rm -rf node_modules dist
pnpm install
pnpm run dev
```

### Full Clean Reinstall

```bash
# Python
pip uninstall -y smartagent
pip cache purge
pip install -e .

# Node
pnpm store prune
rm -rf node_modules artifacts/*/node_modules
pnpm install
```

---

## Getting Help

### Before Reporting Issues

1. Run `validate` and note results
2. Check `logs/mark.log` for errors
3. Try with minimal reproduction case
4. Note: OS, Python version, Node version, Ollama version

### Useful Information to Include

```bash
# System info
python --version && node --version && pnpm --version && ollama --version

# MARK version
python -m smartagent --version

# Test output
pytest tests/test_engineer.py -v 2>&1 | head -50

# Logs
tail -100 logs/mark.log
```

