## Known Issues (Current Version)

| Issue | Workaround | Status |
|-------|------------|--------|
| Dashboard WebSocket disconnects | Refresh page, check API server | Investigating |
| Long-running tasks timeout | Use `long-run` command | By design |
| Large context window OOM | Use smaller model / quantized | Configure model |
| Git push requires auth | Configure SSH keys / token | User setup |

